### PDEs Implemented

| PDE | Type | Scheme | Parameters | Validation |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Poisson** | Elliptic, steady | CG direct solve | $k_1,k_2,k_3 \in \{1..4\}$ | Exact analytical solution |
| **Heat** | Parabolic, time-dep | Backward Euler + CG | Gaussian IC: centers, amplitudes, widths, κ | ROM vs FOM over time |
| **Wave** | Hyperbolic | — | — | — |

